              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "spenden — \"to donate, to give\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Jedes Jahr spenden wir Geld für Kinder in Not. Every year we donate money for children in need."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Blut spenden — to give blood. Die Spende — the donation."
            }
          ]
        },
